# No secrets needed for personal sideload builds (debug-signed APK).
# Only set these as GitHub Actions *Secrets* if you want Play-Store signing:
# MYAPP_UPLOAD_STORE_FILE=release.keystore
# MYAPP_UPLOAD_STORE_PASSWORD=********
# MYAPP_UPLOAD_KEY_ALIAS=verdant
# MYAPP_UPLOAD_KEY_PASSWORD=********
#
# Optional: override the default model without editing code (not wired by
# default — src/models.ts is the source of truth).
# DEFAULT_MODEL_URL=https://huggingface.co/openbmb/MiniCPM5-1B-GGUF/resolve/main/MiniCPM5-1B-Q4_K_M.gguf
